+##
+# @DISPLAY_VISIBILITY:
+#
+# Report whether SDL's primary window is shown and not minimized,
+# on change and every five seconds to maintain a guest idle lease.
+# This does not report occlusion or workspace changes.
+#
+# @console: console index
+# @visible: whether SDL reports the window as shown and not minimized
